OL,3,GNEWSAIt is 'getting better and better'
OL,4,Afor Cherries fans
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs they gathered in the bars and
OL,7,Frestaurants of the picturesque Old Town
OL,8,Fof Vigo, on Spain's Galician coast, AFC
OL,9,FBournemouth fans were hoping their
OL,10,F"miraculous" record-breaking run would
OL,11,Fcontinue.
OL,13,FThe club's first ever European campaign
OL,14,Fcontinues with a fifth game, against La
OL,15,FLiga side Celta Vigo, having already
OL,16,Fsecured wins against teams including AC
OL,17,FMilan and Sparta Prague.
OL,19,FBournemouth are aiming to become the
OL,20,Ffirst English side to win their first
OL,21,Ffive matches in a major European
OL,22,Fcompetition in their debut season.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
